; Built-in boat dashboard of Rigs of Rods, drawn with DearIMGUI (source/main/gui/panels/GUI_BoatDashboard.cpp).
; It has no layout file on purpose: selecting it as default boat dashboard in the Loader switches boats
; without their own dashboard to the built-in one (speed, throttle levers with engine switches,
; heading and rudder, echo sounder, heel/trim, light switches).

dashboard_name "ImGui - Boat"
dashboard_description "Built-in boat dashboard: speed, throttle levers with engine switches, heading and rudder, echo sounder, heel and trim"
dashboard_category   202
